    "message": "docs: make WORKING-NOTES.md a first-class part of the agent contract\n\nAdds a WORKING NOTES section to CLAUDE.md and AGENTS.md telling agents to read\nthe local operating manual before starting non-trivial work, and to maintain it\nin the same session they learn something.\n\nThe notes already exist and are git-ignored on purpose, but nothing pointed at\nthem, so each session rediscovered the same platform quirks and re-litigated\nsettled product decisions. The section names the specific triggers for adding an\nentry -- time lost to something non-obvious, a correction from the user, a\nrelease, a deliberately unfixed gap -- and says to correct stale sections rather\nthan append contradictions.\n\nDocs only; no version bump required.",
